// Title: NetNTLM Downgrade Attack - Registry
// ID: d67572a0-e2ec-45d6-b8db-c100d14b8ef2
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems), wagga, Nasreddine Bencherchali (Splunk STRT)
// Date: 2018-03-20
// Tags: attack.persistence, attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1685, attack.t1112
// Description: Detects NetNTLM downgrade attack
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((TargetObject CONTAINS "SYSTEM\\" AND TargetObject CONTAINS "ControlSet" AND TargetObject CONTAINS "\\Control\\Lsa")) AND ((TargetObject ENDSWITH "\\lmcompatibilitylevel" AND (Details EQ "DWORD (0x00000000)" OR Details EQ "DWORD (0x00000001)" OR Details EQ "DWORD (0x00000002)")) OR (TargetObject ENDSWITH "\\NtlmMinClientSec" AND (Details EQ "DWORD (0x00000000)" OR Details EQ "DWORD (0x00000010)" OR Details EQ "DWORD (0x00000020)" OR Details EQ "DWORD (0x00000030)")) OR (TargetObject ENDSWITH "\\RestrictSendingNTLMTraffic")))
